  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the circuit, the logical value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;when potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and the logical value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;when potential at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0084_f304f397604b.png\" style=\"width: 221px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p>The truth table of the given circuit will be :</p>"
  },
